ASTA Studio - licensing status

No project-wide software license has been selected by the repository owner.
This package does not introduce or imply an additional license grant.
All rights remain with the respective rights holders. Public availability
and Octave packaging do not change that licensing status.

The supplied example plant files and other pre-existing assets retain their
original ownership and terms. The protected original MATLAB implementation
and the course PDFs are not distributed in this package.
